    ($SATQ$28c6bd8c$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$06469-DC$SATQ$, $SATQ$disclosed$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q.B.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Percentages$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, $SATQ$<div xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/apip/apipv1p0/qtiitem/imsqti_v2p1" class="stimulus_reference ">
