s: 4</li><li>16 kilowatt-hours: 1</li><li>23 kilowatt-hours: 1</li></ul></li></ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">For how many of these <math alttext="15"><mn>15</mn>
</math> days did the battery receive a charge of <math alttext="0 kWh"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"09711208-d18b-4025-920b-40d74c3fa263","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"757c0bc0-6631-493f-aa6a-78c3f7fb564a","content":"<p><math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"0098527b-d27f-4057-99dd-5485997ebf76","content":"<p><math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"e61bd15e-594b-4c9b-ad01-fe6ff281b8b2","content":"<p><math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["D"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["e61bd15e-594b-4c9b-ad01-fe6ff281b8b2"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is correct. It's given that the bar graph summarizes the charge, in kilowatt-hours <math alttext="left parenthesis kWh right parenthesis"><mfenced><mtext>kWh</mtext></mfenced></math>, a battery received each day for <math alttext="15"><mn>15</mn>
</math> days. The height of each bar in the bar graph shown represents the number of days the battery received the charge, in <math alttext="kWh"><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>, specified at the bottom of the bar. The bar for a charge of <math alttext="0 kWh"><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>kWh</mtext></math> reaches a height of <math alttext="6"><mn>6</mn>
</math>. Therefore, the battery received a charge of <math alttext="0 kWh"><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>kWh</mtext></math> for <math alttext="6"><mn>6</mn>
</math> of these days.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect. This is the charge, in <math alttext="kWh"><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>, that the battery received, not the number of days the battery received this charge.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. This is the number of days the battery received a charge of either <math alttext="8"><mn>8</mn>
</math>, <math alttext="16"><mn>16</mn>
</math>, or <math alttext="23"><mn>23</mn>
</math> <math alttext="kWh"><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This is the number of days the battery received a charge of <math alttext="11"><mn>11</mn>
</math> <math alttext="kWh"><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"29fa7970","external_id":"f5598292-13c4-4d60-8b84-b381d3c86f9c","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"12f211a3-76ed-4336-b6e6-961c9e639f33","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"Q","domain":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","skill_cd":"Q.C.","skill_desc":"One-variable data: Distributions and measures of center and spread","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":2,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The bar graph summarizes the charge, in kilowatt-hours <math alttext=\"left parenthesis kWh right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mtext>kWh</mtext></mfenced></math>, a battery received each day for <math alttext=\"15\"><mn>15</mn>\n</math> days.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"329.84\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 329.84\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A bar graph. The horizontal axis is labeled Charge, in kilowatt-hours. 6 data categories are shown. The vertical axis is labeled Number of days. It ranges from 0 to 7 in increments of 1. Refer to long description.\"><g id=\"ed420550-79eb-48d4-af01-cd27cdd08af0\" data-name=\"Layer 1\"><defs>\n      <pattern id=\"bar4\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"10\" height=\"100\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(50)\">\n  \t\t<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"5\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#CDCDCD\"></rect>\n  \t\t<rect x=\"5\" y=\"0\" width=\"5\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#444444\"></rect>\n      </pattern>\n      </defs><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"69.359375\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"></line><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"63.359375\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"75.359375\" y2=\"48\" fill=\"none