\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"19.84\" font-family=\"Crimson Text\">Charge (kWh)</text></g></svg><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for bar graph\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>The data for the 6 categories are as follows:<br><ul><li>0 kilowatt-hours: 6</li><li>8 kilowatt-hours: 1</li><li>9 kilowatt-hours: 2</li><li>11 kilowatt-hours: 4</li><li>16 kilowatt-hours: 1</li><li>23 kilowatt-hours: 1</li></ul></li></ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">For how many of these <math alttext=\"15\"><mn>15</mn>\n</math> days did the battery receive a charge of <math alttext=\"0 kWh\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"09711208-d18b-4025-920b-40d74c3fa263","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"757c0bc0-6631-493f-aa6a-78c3f7fb564a","content":"<p><math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"0098527b-d27f-4057-99dd-5485997ebf76","content":"<p><math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"e61bd15e-594b-4c9b-ad01-fe6ff281b8b2","content":"<p><math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math></p>"}],"keys":["e61bd15e-594b-4c9b-ad01-fe6ff281b8b2"],"correct_answer":["D"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. It's given that the bar graph summarizes the charge, in kilowatt-hours <math alttext=\"left parenthesis kWh right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mtext>kWh</mtext></mfenced></math>, a battery received each day for <math alttext=\"15\"><mn>15</mn>\n</math> days. The height of each bar in the bar graph shown represents the number of days the battery received the charge, in <math alttext=\"kWh\"><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>, specified at the bottom of the bar. The bar for a charge of <math alttext=\"0 kWh\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>kWh</mtext></math> reaches a height of <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math>. Therefore, the battery received a charge of <math alttext=\"0 kWh\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>kWh</mtext></math> for <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math> of these days.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is the charge, in <math alttext=\"kWh\"><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>, that the battery received, not the number of days the battery received this charge.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This is the number of days the battery received a charge of either <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"16\"><mn>16</mn>\n</math>, or <math alttext=\"23\"><mn>23</mn>\n</math> <math alttext=\"kWh\"><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is the number of days the battery received a charge of <math alttext=\"11\"><mn>11</mn>\n</math> <math alttext=\"kWh\"><mtext>kWh</mtext></math>.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1743430554988,"pPcc":"SAT#Q","questionId":"29fa7970","skill_cd":"Q.C.","score_band_range_cd":2,"skill_desc":"One-variable data: Distributions and measures of center and spread","createDate":1743430554988,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","ibn":"","external_id":"f5598292-13c4-4d60-8b84-b381d3c86f9c","primary_class_cd":"Q","uId":"12f211a3-76ed-4336-b6e6-961c9e639f33","difficulty":"E"},"raw_detail":{"type":"mcq","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The bar graph summarizes the charge, in kilowatt-hours <math alttext=\"left parenthesis kWh right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mtext>kWh</mtext></mfenced></math>, a battery received each day for <math alttext=\"15\"><mn>15</mn>\n</math> days.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400\" height=\"329.84\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 329.84\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A bar graph. The horizontal axis is labeled Charge, in kilowatt-hours. 6 data categories are shown. The vertical axis is labeled Number of days