    ($SATQ$2c76bcce$SATQ$, $SATQ$e32ac8cc-1200-4ebd-9897-0c30b06a3bdf$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q.F.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Inference from sample statistics and margin of error $SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 3, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">A company designs and makes handbags. To estimate the mean weight of the handbags made by the company on a particular day, a sample of the handbags made by the company on that day was selected at random. Based on the sample, it is estimated that the mean weight of all handbags made by the company on that day is <math alttext="27.8 ounces left parenthesis oz right parenthesis"><mn>27.8</mn>
