    ($SATQ$2e511919$SATQ$, $SATQ$363d5daa-100c-4c65-80bf-bd1ca694191d$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$c1419a19-b100-4668-a03e-e63e3e39f29f$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q.D.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Two-variable data: Models and scatterplots$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 1, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The line graph shows the estimated number of chipmunks in a state park on April&nbsp;<math alttext="1"><mn>1</mn></math> of each year from&nbsp;<math alttext="1989"><mn>1989</mn></math> to <math alttext="1999"><mn>1999</mn></math>.</p>
