</math>?</p>$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$["9.87","987/100"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["9.87","987/100"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The correct answer is <math alttext="9.87"><mn>9.87</mn>
