    ($SATQ$312ba47c$SATQ$, $SATQ$d88daa3d-713d-4905-8fc3-540215e519e9$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$c284b25b-900d-4797-8bda-9db7773107c5$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Problem-Solving and Data Analysis$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q$SATQ$, $SATQ$Q.A.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Ratios, rates, proportional relationships, and units$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 1, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">In a box of pens, the ratio of black pens to red pens is <math alttext="8"><mn>8</mn>
</math> to <math alttext="1"><mn>1</mn>
</math>. There are <math alttext="40"><mn>40</mn>
